WEBVTT

00:00:19.490 --> 00:00:26.750
<i>New days, it's the morning we begin. 
Let's give the world a kiss.</i>

00:00:27.710 --> 00:00:35.240
<i>Blowing in the wind, with a little 
courage and love in our pockets.</i>

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:44.090
<i>I wish: If only I had wings,</i>

00:00:45.390 --> 00:00:53.690
<i>I could fly over the sadness, 
the past, and my doubts.</i>

00:00:53.690 --> 00:01:02.450
<i>Oh, yeah! There's nothing to lose. 
(Take whatever the brand new day brings.)</i>

00:01:02.450 --> 00:01:07.290
<i>Take my way! I wanna catch a miracle...</i>

00:01:07.290 --> 00:01:11.030
<i>in the palm of my hand!</i>

00:01:11.800 --> 00:01:19.720
<i>We're off on a journey through the endless 
earth, the skies, and the future.</i>

00:01:20.290 --> 00:01:32.140
<i>I know these newborn wings, oh! 
Are gonna gonna gonna shine someday!</i>

00:01:47.410 --> 00:01:51.290
Well, well. You're the spitting 
image of Prince Forsyth.

00:01:52.040 --> 00:01:53.840
So, you're Pacifica Cassul?

00:01:53.840 --> 00:01:56.300
I am not! I'm Pamela!

00:01:56.300 --> 00:01:58.720
Let me out of here right now!

00:01:58.720 --> 00:02:01.300
Oh, you're trying to talk 
your way out of here, eh?

00:02:01.300 --> 00:02:04.010
Or do you actually have amnesia?

00:02:04.640 --> 00:02:06.840
Either way, I'm afraid I can't do that.

00:02:07.520 --> 00:02:10.480
Come with me. Your father awaits.

00:02:12.440 --> 00:02:17.440
"Prelude to the Divinely-Ordered Collapse"

00:02:19.030 --> 00:02:20.910
Queen Elmyr is dead?!

00:02:20.910 --> 00:02:23.660
They said that she died just a while ago.

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:28.580
Apparently, the Blackhawks 
disposed of the body secretly.

00:02:28.580 --> 00:02:31.500
It's no wonder; they say she 
was put under intense torture.

00:02:32.040 --> 00:02:35.210
Do you think they'll announce that 
she died of an illness sometime soon?

00:02:39.180 --> 00:02:40.800
Jill?

00:02:40.800 --> 00:02:42.280
Do you see something?

00:02:42.750 --> 00:02:45.840
Yes... I see people dying.

00:02:46.610 --> 00:02:47.600
Many of them.

00:02:59.320 --> 00:03:01.660
We have brought the Scrapped 
Princess, Majesty.

00:03:06.910 --> 00:03:08.950
Introduce yourself to His Majesty.

00:03:10.410 --> 00:03:12.370
This man is my father?

00:03:15.710 --> 00:03:16.800
An ill omen!

00:03:17.140 --> 00:03:19.110
Off with that girl's head!

00:03:20.220 --> 00:03:22.210
You're the accursed poison...

00:03:22.210 --> 00:03:24.220
You're Elmyr, come back from the dead!

00:03:24.930 --> 00:03:25.950
Take her away.

00:03:25.950 --> 00:03:26.600
Yes, sir.

00:03:26.600 --> 00:03:28.610
Huh? What's going on?

00:03:28.610 --> 00:03:29.730
Are we done already?

00:03:29.730 --> 00:03:31.670
What the heck is going on?!

00:03:31.670 --> 00:03:32.760
Come on!

00:03:33.230 --> 00:03:36.020
Majesty, the Scrapped Princess

00:03:36.020 --> 00:03:38.690
is our ultimate trump card 
against the Peacemakers.

00:03:39.240 --> 00:03:42.490
Perhaps it would be wisest to spare 
her and use her as a bargaining chip.

00:03:42.490 --> 00:03:43.660
I know!

00:03:44.410 --> 00:03:45.880
I know that...

00:03:50.410 --> 00:03:51.290
They're back.

00:03:51.290 --> 00:03:52.620
Excuse me?

00:03:52.620 --> 00:03:54.460
The young lady here was about to go.

00:03:54.460 --> 00:03:55.500
Go where?

00:03:55.500 --> 00:03:57.550
You don't mean to the castle, do you?

00:03:57.550 --> 00:03:59.020
I don't have any choice.

00:03:59.020 --> 00:04:00.920
If we don't act quickly, Pacifica might be...

00:04:00.920 --> 00:04:03.970
But there are lots of army units out there!

00:04:03.970 --> 00:04:05.430
How will you get inside?

00:04:07.000 --> 00:04:10.470
Powers that bend light, envelop me.

00:04:10.470 --> 00:04:11.350
What in the...?

00:04:11.710 --> 00:04:12.850
Miss Raquel?

00:04:12.850 --> 00:04:13.850
Right here.

00:04:13.850 --> 00:04:17.060
All you can see is a distortion in 
what you're standing in front of.

00:04:17.060 --> 00:04:18.270
That's amazing...

00:04:20.570 --> 00:04:22.240
Welcome back, my little alter ego.

00:04:27.240 --> 00:04:29.660
Looks like the little lady 
is alive and kicking.

00:04:30.240 --> 00:04:32.960
There are hundreds of 
soldiers inside the castle.

00:04:32.960 --> 00:04:34.620
That many?

00:04:41.510 --> 00:04:43.670
What did you talk about with those people?

00:04:45.990 --> 00:04:50.600
Are the rumors true that the Royal Forces 
have captured the Scrapped Princess?

00:04:51.600 --> 00:04:52.800
Beats me.

00:04:55.140 --> 00:04:57.410
If Pacifica really were here,

00:04:57.410 --> 00:04:59.190
what would you do if you found her?

00:04:59.190 --> 00:05:00.640
You know the answer to that.

00:05:00.640 --> 00:05:01.900
I'd terminate her.

00:05:01.900 --> 00:05:04.030
Do you think I'd stand by and watch?

00:05:04.400 --> 00:05:06.660
You can resist if you like,

00:05:06.660 --> 00:05:09.870
but if you do, many more people will die.

00:05:10.740 --> 00:05:14.040
We're never going to find any common 
ground to reach a compromise, are we?

00:05:14.040 --> 00:05:15.080
Of course not.

00:05:15.580 --> 00:05:20.360
Less than 200 hours remain before 
the Scrapped Princess turns sixteen.

00:05:21.060 --> 00:05:26.560
I am only accompanying you so that 
I may keep you under surveillance.

00:05:26.560 --> 00:05:29.600
I have no interest in your 
desires or your feelings,

00:05:29.600 --> 00:05:32.060
and no need to look for your understanding.

00:05:35.480 --> 00:05:37.280
His Majesty awaits.

00:05:37.280 --> 00:05:40.020
Lady Peacemaker, we would 
like you to join him.

00:05:55.940 --> 00:05:58.640
You can see the Great Temple from here...

00:05:58.640 --> 00:05:59.380
The damn thing's too...

00:05:59.820 --> 00:06:04.560
I mean, this humble servant of Mauser 
has always found it too ostentatious.

00:06:05.370 --> 00:06:08.880
You seem rather open-minded 
for a priest of Mauser.

00:06:09.320 --> 00:06:12.850
Please feel free to be frank and 
call me too worldly, Highness.

00:06:12.850 --> 00:06:15.100
I know better than anybody that I'm 
not cut out for the priesthood.

00:06:19.060 --> 00:06:20.170
Stop the coach.

00:06:23.820 --> 00:06:25.570
Is something the matter?

00:06:25.570 --> 00:06:29.990
Yes, sir... I was walking, and 
my chest suddenly began to...

00:06:30.450 --> 00:06:32.450
I'm sorry to hear that.

00:06:32.890 --> 00:06:34.410
Is this where it hurts?

00:06:35.160 --> 00:06:37.310
Here, mister. Drink this.

00:06:37.310 --> 00:06:39.460
You'll feel better soon.

00:06:39.460 --> 00:06:42.480
Thank you so much, Father...

00:06:43.020 --> 00:06:44.420
Are you traveling with these children?

00:06:44.960 --> 00:06:45.670
Yes, sir...

00:06:46.390 --> 00:06:50.250
My son and his wife died in that 
huge tidal wave a while ago.

00:06:50.250 --> 00:06:52.470
We have no other relatives to turn to,

00:06:52.470 --> 00:06:55.940
so I thought of throwing ourselves 
upon Mauser's mercy...

00:06:55.940 --> 00:06:57.600
So we came to Grendel...

00:06:58.270 --> 00:06:59.940
Huge tidal wave?

00:06:59.940 --> 00:07:02.400
He must mean the one 
triggered by Ginnungagap.

00:07:02.400 --> 00:07:06.230
They say that the wave 
killed over 100 people.

00:07:08.780 --> 00:07:10.100
Prince Forsyth?

00:07:10.740 --> 00:07:13.960
It is always the helpless 
commoners who suffer...

00:07:14.490 --> 00:07:15.580
I'm sorry...

00:07:15.580 --> 00:07:17.190
Please forgive me.

00:07:26.040 --> 00:07:28.010
Shannon Cassul.

00:07:28.010 --> 00:07:30.880
Have you given any thought 
to the matter we discussed?

00:07:31.900 --> 00:07:34.530
Personally, I don't think 
that you have any choice.

00:07:35.180 --> 00:07:38.390
And as for you, my good Lady Peacemaker.

00:07:38.970 --> 00:07:42.640
We would like to formally 
request your cooperation.

00:07:42.640 --> 00:07:43.930
Our cooperation?

00:07:44.480 --> 00:07:48.150
We are well aware that 
you possess great power.

00:07:48.780 --> 00:07:50.130
In ordinary circumstances,

00:07:50.130 --> 00:07:52.990
you would most likely be 
too dangerous for us humans

00:07:52.990 --> 00:07:55.410
to even attempt to negotiate with.

00:07:55.410 --> 00:07:57.870
As such, we have taken the liberty 
of obtaining some insurance.

00:07:58.910 --> 00:08:00.080
Please observe.

00:08:00.830 --> 00:08:03.510
The one and only threat to your kind.

00:08:03.510 --> 00:08:04.540
The Scrapped Princess.

00:08:07.320 --> 00:08:08.750
Pacifica!

00:08:10.450 --> 00:08:11.880
Kill that girl.

00:08:11.880 --> 00:08:13.090
Don't do it!

00:08:13.860 --> 00:08:14.550
Stop!

00:08:30.780 --> 00:08:33.150
Steyr, why did you stop him?

00:08:33.580 --> 00:08:35.410
Because this looked interesting.

00:08:35.410 --> 00:08:39.160
You can always kill her after 
we've heard what he has to say.

00:08:39.580 --> 00:08:41.040
Why, you...

00:08:41.040 --> 00:08:44.210
Besides, we don't want to 
provoke the Providence Breaker

00:08:44.210 --> 00:08:46.670
and accidentally trigger 
her power, now do we?

00:08:47.130 --> 00:08:47.730
Hey.

00:08:47.730 --> 00:08:48.540
Yes, sir!

00:08:50.630 --> 00:08:51.680
Pacifica!

00:08:51.680 --> 00:08:52.420
Stand back!

00:08:53.010 --> 00:08:53.880
Are you all right?!

00:08:55.540 --> 00:08:56.390
Furet...

00:08:57.140 --> 00:08:57.730
What?

00:08:57.730 --> 00:08:59.600
Oh. I'm sorry.

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:02.470
What are you talking about, kid?

00:09:02.470 --> 00:09:03.680
Huh?

00:09:03.680 --> 00:09:07.310
Um... You wouldn't happen 
to know me, would you?

00:09:09.610 --> 00:09:12.480
Now, would you mind continuing 
your little proposal?

00:09:12.990 --> 00:09:14.710
Where have I seen you before?

00:09:15.410 --> 00:09:16.450
Never mind.

00:09:16.450 --> 00:09:17.770
Oh, now I see.

00:09:17.770 --> 00:09:21.160
That must have been Peacemaker 
mind control just now.

00:09:21.160 --> 00:09:23.660
As I recall, we're not supposed 
to look you in the eyes.

00:09:26.620 --> 00:09:32.630
Our forces are already making preparations 
to march on the Giat Empire.

00:09:32.630 --> 00:09:34.290
We intend to start with Giat,

00:09:34.290 --> 00:09:38.230
and bring all the countries around 
us under our rule one by one.

00:09:38.230 --> 00:09:41.180
We have power enough to do it,

00:09:41.180 --> 00:09:43.930
and should our D-Knight 
friend choose to aid us,

00:09:43.930 --> 00:09:47.460
it will be only a matter of time 
before we rule the whole land.

00:09:47.460 --> 00:09:50.020
In other words, we don't need the Peacemakers

00:09:50.020 --> 00:09:52.940
to take any concrete action for us.

00:09:53.330 --> 00:09:58.530
You need only grant tacit approval 
to our domination of the world.

00:09:58.530 --> 00:10:04.200
And in return, we pledge that we will 
strictly control the Scrapped Princess

00:10:04.200 --> 00:10:06.960
to see that she proves no threat to you.

00:10:09.000 --> 00:10:11.420
Your stupidity knows no bounds, does it?

00:10:11.860 --> 00:10:13.250
Excuse me?

00:10:13.250 --> 00:10:17.880
What we want is the elimination of the 
Scrapped Princess' very existence.

00:10:17.880 --> 00:10:20.180
There is no alternate option here.

00:10:20.970 --> 00:10:22.230
"Control" her?

00:10:22.850 --> 00:10:25.170
You, a mere human?

00:10:25.170 --> 00:10:26.600
You don't know your place.

00:10:27.100 --> 00:10:32.190
Perhaps, but your kind are afraid of 
a "mere" human girl, are they not?

00:10:32.190 --> 00:10:33.700
She is a bad influence.

00:10:33.700 --> 00:10:35.860
As such, we must eliminate her.

00:10:35.860 --> 00:10:38.070
Whether or not we "fear" her is irrelevant.

00:10:39.740 --> 00:10:42.910
Even so, as long as the Scrapped 
Princess is in our possession,

00:10:42.910 --> 00:10:45.330
I imagine that you can't easily 
take any action against us.

00:10:46.040 --> 00:10:48.640
We would like you to 
acquiesce to our demands.

00:10:50.500 --> 00:10:51.630
You find that funny?

00:10:51.630 --> 00:10:52.810
I do.

00:10:52.810 --> 00:10:55.840
I never imagined that you would 
dance to my tune this well.

00:10:56.510 --> 00:10:59.050
Nicely done. You deserve a round of applause.

00:11:00.510 --> 00:11:02.890
Steyr? You planned this?

00:11:02.890 --> 00:11:05.350
Now do you understand, Cz?

00:11:05.350 --> 00:11:09.310
These fools pushed the 
button all on their own.

00:11:09.310 --> 00:11:11.770
They flipped the reset switch.

00:11:11.770 --> 00:11:14.730
It's being deliberated within 
the system as we speak,

00:11:14.730 --> 00:11:16.230
but the outcome is as good as certain.

00:11:17.110 --> 00:11:21.270
You should have had your little war within 
the established framework of the system.

00:11:21.910 --> 00:11:25.280
In the event that a group of fools 
gets the notion in their heads

00:11:25.280 --> 00:11:29.250
that they should try to use the power 
of us Peacemakers to their own ends,

00:11:29.250 --> 00:11:32.080
we are granted the following authority.

00:11:32.690 --> 00:11:35.540
We are authorized to return human 
civilization to a blank slate.

00:11:36.540 --> 00:11:40.610
Oh, don't you worry. You 
aren't going to be wiped out.

00:11:40.610 --> 00:11:43.260
We're going to cull about 90% 
of the human race, that's all.

00:11:43.260 --> 00:11:44.890
You bunch of...!

00:11:44.890 --> 00:11:50.480
You humans prune a flower bed to prevent 
the whole thing from dying, don't you?

00:11:50.820 --> 00:11:54.400
Honestly, humanity is such a 
troublesome little species.

00:11:55.150 --> 00:11:57.370
It looks like the system 
has granted its approval.

00:12:06.230 --> 00:12:08.540
What is it? What's this commotion?

00:12:12.000 --> 00:12:13.920
Sounds like something's spooking the horses.

00:12:16.290 --> 00:12:17.880
Dragunov?!

00:12:18.230 --> 00:12:20.900
What in the world are you doing here?

00:12:20.900 --> 00:12:22.220
Miss Raquel! Look!

00:12:35.930 --> 00:12:37.030
Chris!

00:12:38.380 --> 00:12:40.030
What in the world is <i>that</i>?!

00:12:42.470 --> 00:12:43.730
The capital.

00:13:02.380 --> 00:13:03.470
Stop it!

00:13:03.470 --> 00:13:05.160
My, how impudent.

00:13:05.160 --> 00:13:06.590
This is divine punishment.

00:13:07.030 --> 00:13:08.640
Punishment against humanity,

00:13:08.640 --> 00:13:11.680
which allowed the Scrapped Princess 
to live for sixteen years.

00:13:14.770 --> 00:13:16.650
I can't believe it...

00:13:16.650 --> 00:13:19.610
How can the power of the 
Peacemakers be this great?

00:13:19.610 --> 00:13:21.820
Kill her! Kill that girl at once!

00:13:23.030 --> 00:13:25.700
I ordered her to be killed 
while she was still a baby!

00:13:26.150 --> 00:13:27.610
Kill her!

00:13:27.610 --> 00:13:28.870
He's right!

00:13:28.870 --> 00:13:31.410
It's her! It's all her fault!

00:13:31.770 --> 00:13:33.580
Kill her! Hurry up and kill her!

00:13:34.500 --> 00:13:35.290
Kill her!

00:13:35.290 --> 00:13:36.250
H-Hey, wait a minute...

00:13:36.250 --> 00:13:39.290
Yeah! Kill her!

00:13:37.040 --> 00:13:39.290
I haven't done anything!

00:13:39.290 --> 00:13:40.380
Why are you doing this?

00:13:39.290 --> 00:13:40.380
Kill her!

00:13:54.600 --> 00:13:56.940
You're still trying to protect that girl?

00:13:56.940 --> 00:14:00.980
The destruction of the world 
has begun, and it's her fault.

00:14:00.980 --> 00:14:05.860
Or are you trying to say that this girl 
is worth exchanging the world for?

00:14:06.280 --> 00:14:07.340
Worth?

00:14:08.290 --> 00:14:10.370
How much is the world worth, exactly?

00:14:11.780 --> 00:14:15.000
If you kill her, how will 
you be saving the world?

00:14:16.330 --> 00:14:19.620
Is the world really worth more than her?

00:14:21.040 --> 00:14:23.190
How much is a world worth

00:14:23.190 --> 00:14:27.340
that won't tolerate the existence 
of this one little sister of mine?!

00:14:28.520 --> 00:14:30.930
I can't protect the world.

00:14:30.930 --> 00:14:33.810
I'm not a god, and I'm not a Peacemaker.

00:14:34.600 --> 00:14:37.770
If you're telling me to choose between 
killing my sister or protecting her,

00:14:38.210 --> 00:14:40.480
then I'm gonna protect her as long 
as there's breath left in me!

00:14:50.570 --> 00:14:51.560
Sha...

00:14:52.990 --> 00:14:54.740
Shannon!

00:15:07.220 --> 00:15:07.910
Kill her!

00:15:07.910 --> 00:15:09.170
Don't kill her!

00:15:13.330 --> 00:15:14.010
Pacifica!

00:15:14.820 --> 00:15:16.100
Move it!

00:15:16.100 --> 00:15:16.970
Get out of my way!

00:15:17.470 --> 00:15:18.890
Colonel Sturm!

00:15:18.890 --> 00:15:20.600
Take the Scrapped Princess into custody!

00:15:20.600 --> 00:15:22.190
But the king's orders!

00:15:22.850 --> 00:15:25.730
Maintaining order inside the 
castle takes top priority now.

00:15:25.730 --> 00:15:26.270
Get moving!

00:15:26.270 --> 00:15:27.200
Yes, sir!

00:15:29.990 --> 00:15:31.070
Shannon!

00:15:31.070 --> 00:15:32.580
Pacifica!

00:15:33.030 --> 00:15:34.490
Shannon!

00:15:35.120 --> 00:15:36.920
Get out of my way!

00:15:40.370 --> 00:15:42.420
All of you! Protect us!

00:15:42.420 --> 00:15:45.130
Protect us! I said to protect us!

00:15:48.090 --> 00:15:49.360
Now, then...

00:15:49.360 --> 00:15:52.050
Carrying out the reset has top priority,

00:15:52.050 --> 00:15:54.260
so I'll go help Socom.

00:15:54.260 --> 00:15:56.930
I'll leave the Providence Breaker to you.

00:15:56.930 --> 00:15:59.100
Just a moment. Explain yourself.

00:15:59.100 --> 00:15:59.810
Explain what?

00:15:59.810 --> 00:16:01.480
Don't play dumb.

00:16:01.480 --> 00:16:05.160
You gave them more information 
than was necessary

00:16:05.160 --> 00:16:07.330
and deliberately brought 
about their destruction.

00:16:07.330 --> 00:16:08.710
Why did you do this, Steyr?

00:16:10.070 --> 00:16:12.150
You've been in a compressed 
state all this time,

00:16:12.150 --> 00:16:13.990
so I suppose you wouldn't understand.

00:16:14.860 --> 00:16:17.030
I've watched them these 5,000 years.

00:16:17.030 --> 00:16:19.700
I've watched this foolish 
creature called humanity.

00:16:20.370 --> 00:16:23.460
No matter how much time passes, they 
will always be repulsive creatures

00:16:23.460 --> 00:16:25.170
that do nothing but kill their own kind.

00:16:25.730 --> 00:16:28.460
We are Peacemakers.

00:16:28.460 --> 00:16:32.300
We'll take apart this hopelessly 
diseased human society

00:16:32.300 --> 00:16:35.390
and build a healthy new world from scratch.

00:16:36.680 --> 00:16:40.720
Or will you destroy me and 
go over to the humans' side?

00:16:46.100 --> 00:16:49.610
Manifest class two divine 
retribution configuration.

00:16:53.900 --> 00:16:57.070
Peacemakers are destroying Leinwan's capital.

00:16:58.950 --> 00:16:59.780
Eirote!

00:16:59.780 --> 00:17:01.120
Ma'am?

00:17:01.120 --> 00:17:02.200
What's our status?

00:17:02.200 --> 00:17:03.120
We're ready.

00:17:03.120 --> 00:17:05.790
Ruth! Drake! Get ready to move out!

00:17:12.760 --> 00:17:14.180
What kept you?

00:17:14.180 --> 00:17:16.350
Resets don't come along every day.

00:17:16.350 --> 00:17:19.720
It would be such a shame if we didn't take 
our time and savor it, don't you think?

00:17:20.600 --> 00:17:23.480
Pacifica! Pacifica!

00:17:23.480 --> 00:17:24.770
My master.

00:17:24.770 --> 00:17:26.100
Zefiris?

00:17:26.100 --> 00:17:28.810
Steyr has set loose proxies 
within the capital.

00:17:29.100 --> 00:17:30.770
They number roughly one hundred.

00:17:36.870 --> 00:17:37.910
What's that?!

00:17:37.910 --> 00:17:41.160
That's... That's one of those 
things that were in Taurus!

00:17:46.290 --> 00:17:47.420
Don't let the tentacles touch you!

00:17:47.420 --> 00:17:48.910
They'll suck you in!

00:17:48.910 --> 00:17:50.330
Understood!

00:17:51.090 --> 00:17:52.380
There's no end to these things!

00:17:58.090 --> 00:17:59.140
Prince Forsyth!

00:17:59.140 --> 00:18:00.220
Let me go!

00:18:00.220 --> 00:18:02.510
If I don't go back, the people 
of the capital will...

00:18:02.820 --> 00:18:04.140
What will you do there?!

00:18:04.600 --> 00:18:08.810
If you die, who's going 
to rebuild the capital?

00:18:10.980 --> 00:18:12.320
Pacifica!

00:18:12.320 --> 00:18:14.870
Damn it! Which way did she go?!

00:18:14.870 --> 00:18:16.950
It seems that she's been locked away.

00:18:16.950 --> 00:18:18.780
Somewhere in the military wing.

00:18:18.780 --> 00:18:20.740
Is she all right?

00:18:20.740 --> 00:18:21.730
I do not know.

00:18:21.730 --> 00:18:26.040
But you heard the words of that 
man who was giving the orders.

00:18:26.430 --> 00:18:27.710
He said not to kill her.

00:18:28.790 --> 00:18:30.560
Given the situation,

00:18:30.560 --> 00:18:33.380
he struck me as the most 
level-headed individual there.

00:18:33.380 --> 00:18:35.170
His true intentions are unclear, though.

00:18:37.070 --> 00:18:39.100
Damn those bastards!

00:18:39.710 --> 00:18:45.010
Socom is powerful enough to wipe out half 
of the human race within a few hours.

00:18:46.330 --> 00:18:48.770
Your top priority now should be to minimize

00:18:48.770 --> 00:18:50.510
the number of fatalities, should it not?

00:18:51.100 --> 00:18:53.710
I thought you said that some 
losses were to be expected.

00:18:54.480 --> 00:18:56.840
But that is not what you wish.

00:18:56.840 --> 00:19:00.240
I have decided to obey your will.

00:19:00.990 --> 00:19:03.700
Even though you might not trust me...

00:19:05.240 --> 00:19:07.300
No, I'll trust you.

00:19:08.410 --> 00:19:12.370
You people stole so much from us.

00:19:12.370 --> 00:19:16.060
But the freedom to choose 
to trust you or doubt you...

00:19:16.060 --> 00:19:19.670
That's one thing you haven't 
taken away from us.

00:19:20.850 --> 00:19:22.180
I trust you.

00:19:24.170 --> 00:19:26.160
We'll defeat the Peacemakers,

00:19:26.160 --> 00:19:27.640
and then rescue Pacifica.

00:19:28.430 --> 00:19:29.440
Zefiris,

00:19:30.260 --> 00:19:32.920
lend me all the power you 
have at your disposal.

00:19:34.130 --> 00:19:35.110
Thank you.

00:19:50.690 --> 00:19:52.920
So, they've achieved complete fusion...

00:19:54.510 --> 00:19:58.310
Manifest class two divine 
punishment configuration.

00:20:03.090 --> 00:20:06.260
What am I doing in this castle?

00:20:07.220 --> 00:20:09.080
What have I been doing?

00:20:13.010 --> 00:20:14.650
Shannon!

00:20:17.950 --> 00:20:19.040
Shannon?!

00:20:26.450 --> 00:20:28.930
Well, well, I hardly recognize you.

00:20:28.930 --> 00:20:31.450
You're fully activated, are you?

00:20:31.450 --> 00:20:34.320
Even so, it's three on one.

00:20:34.320 --> 00:20:36.250
You don't stand a chance of winning.

00:20:36.250 --> 00:20:37.750
Look closer!

00:20:38.350 --> 00:20:40.460
I'd count again if I were you.

00:20:41.170 --> 00:20:42.420
Gigases?

00:20:42.720 --> 00:20:43.880
Senes?!

00:20:48.240 --> 00:20:50.810
Shannon Cassul... Mind if we join in?

00:21:00.780 --> 00:21:02.100
Big brother!

00:21:16.580 --> 00:21:21.730
<i>A blessing of rain falls quietly. (Falls.)</i>

00:21:21.730 --> 00:21:27.050
<i>Droplets of my love, 
which fall for someone...</i>

00:21:27.050 --> 00:21:34.230
<i>who is still waiting in a land far away.</i>

00:21:34.230 --> 00:21:40.020
<i>The morning wind blows, caressing 
my cheek. (What was that...)</i>

00:21:40.020 --> 00:21:45.150
<i>Did you feel something, feel something 
just now? (...on my cheek?)</i>

00:21:45.150 --> 00:21:48.320
<i>It goes up to the one and only sky... 
(More certain than anything.)</i>

00:21:48.320 --> 00:21:53.370
<i>a sky which has a fixed, certain meaning.</i>

00:21:53.370 --> 00:21:59.920
<i>I come to a stop in the shadow 
of clouds that chase after me.</i>

00:21:59.920 --> 00:22:03.380
<i>This journey of the heart 
that I wish to gaze upon...</i>

00:22:03.380 --> 00:22:06.590
<i>goes on forever and goes on forever.</i>

00:22:06.590 --> 00:22:13.220
<i>One day I will chance upon the 
voice I've not heard in so long.</i>

00:22:13.220 --> 00:22:15.180
<i>Alainn la-li-la.</i>

00:22:15.180 --> 00:22:19.900
<i>At last the ship sets sail, sets sail. 
(The ship glides on forever...)</i>

00:22:19.900 --> 00:22:25.190
<i>Yes, believe in this wide world... 
(...to the edge of seas unknown.)</i>

00:22:25.190 --> 00:22:28.530
<i>and go off into the distance.</i>

00:22:28.530 --> 00:22:32.630
<i>And onwards into the future.</i>

00:22:33.450 --> 00:22:46.460
"Next Time"

00:22:34.080 --> 00:22:37.540
Shannon fights the Peacemakers, 
who are trying to reset the world.

00:22:37.540 --> 00:22:40.040
Elsewhere, Raquel is waylaid by 
proxies as she makes for the castle

00:22:40.040 --> 00:22:41.000
to rescue her sister.

00:22:41.000 --> 00:22:42.840
Pacifica has gotten her memory back,

00:22:42.840 --> 00:22:44.800
but all she can do is 
watch her brother fight.

00:22:44.800 --> 00:22:47.380
They left her in shackles, so I bet 
her hands are about to go numb, huh?

00:22:47.380 --> 00:22:48.600
Next time on <i>Scrapped Princess</i>,

00:22:48.600 --> 00:22:49.800
"The Passion of the Lonely God."

00:22:49.800 --> 00:22:50.470
Please tune in!
